                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "2c9835de-fc8b-4861-8642-2963588c4cde",
                        "entry_id": "7607d704-ed86-3ce5-94db-5feadcc75b15",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural",
                            "masculine",
                            "feminine"
                        ],
                        "form": "enviables"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "06ba7eef-7d91-39d7-9d02-bf68a56d528f",
                        "entry_id": "7607d704-ed86-3ce5-94db-5feadcc75b15",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Qui est digne d’envie."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "5b67ddd6-43a3-44b2-b734-8972e3d238a3",
                                "sense_id": "06ba7eef-7d91-39d7-9d02-bf68a56d528f",
                                "text": "En Bourgogne, la situation des juifs n’étaient, d’ailleurs, guère plus enviable qu’en Neustrie (Ile de France, Normandie)."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "2532ba24-4add-4cf4-a139-6a50fb61a231",
                                "sense_id": "06ba7eef-7d91-39d7-9d02-bf68a56d528f",
                                "text": "Peu de chefs religieux bénéficient d’une réputation aussi enviable que celle de Tenzin Gyasto, chef spirituel et temporel du Tibet bouddhiste, qui se fait aussi appeler Sa Sainteté le dalaï-lama."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "f55e1f3e-6197-4c2b-a7d4-b4092eb5a243",
                                "sense_id": "06ba7eef-7d91-39d7-9d02-bf68a56d528f",
                                "text": "Mais que nous reste-t-il aujourd’hui du vaporwave, moins de dix ans après son apparition ? S’il est moins populaire qu’à son apogée de 2011-2012, le genre génère encore un buzz enviable sur les réseaux sociaux."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "ee1c0c0a-98c0-4e4f-915a-583d7a00db2c",
                        "source_entry_id": "7607d704-ed86-3ce5-94db-5feadcc75b15",
                        "source_sense_id": "06ba7eef-7d91-39d7-9d02-bf68a56d528f",
                        "target_lang_word": "beneidenswert",
                        "target_lang_code": "de",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "beneidenswert",
                                "target_lang_code": "de",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "5ed82cb5-00c0-3f4c-aacf-632d9fe02746",
                                        "entry_id": "0b849735-a5aa-3d85-9279-ad4787d2c93e",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "so beschaffen, dass es andere auch so haben möchten"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "60bb8710-1f4b-472b-8d23-500e97f8ff87",
                                                "sense_id": "5ed82cb5-00c0-3f4c-aacf-632d9fe02746",
                                                "text": "Dir geht es hier beneidenswert gut."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c31e04b3-b553-47a7-a554-9882cb00b1e0",
                                                "sense_id": "5ed82cb5-00c0-3f4c-aacf-632d9fe02746",
                                                "text": "Du hast einen schönen, beneidenswerten Garten."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "dcb9f034-57b6-44e6-91f6-fcf65162ff20",
                                                "sense_id": "5ed82cb5-00c0-3f4c-aacf-632d9fe02746",
                                                "text": "„Überhaupt sind alle Fürsten und ihre Paladine, die auf jener Seite stehen, von beneidenswerter Schönheit, lauter Adonisse, Lohengrine oder Siegfriede.“"
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "2cbdf7e4-6c11-4795-b704-5a7ba64ff816",
                        "source_entry_id": "7607d704-ed86-3ce5-94db-5feadcc75b15",
                        "source_sense_id": "06ba7eef-7d91-39d7-9d02-bf68a56d528f",
                        "target_lang_word": "enviable",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "enviable",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "0a8333a4-a483-38e8-9281-dc45c9a8389a",
                                        "entry_id": "f7013995-aa6a-31ac-b77e-f93f7752374a",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Arousing or likely to arouse envy."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6ce71ece-9422-4fa6-8ce3-0a68d792d645",
                                                "sense_id": "0a8333a4-a483-38e8-9281-dc45c9a8389a",
                                                "text": "He [Douglas William Jerrold] had achieved many enviable dramatic successes before this time."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "39606541-3929-441c-9b5a-1546c65e95cc",
                                                "sense_id": "0a8333a4-a483-38e8-9281-dc45c9a8389a",
                                                "text": "To superficial observers it might well seem that William [III of England] was, at this time, one of the most enviable of human beings. He was in truth one of the most anxious and unhappy."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "66872eee-2d61-411e-8db1-91be84d21338",
                                                "sense_id": "0a8333a4-a483-38e8-9281-dc45c9a8389a",
                                                "text": "Sundrie other Gent[lemen] reſt beholden to this hundred, for their dvvellings, vvho, in an enuiable mediocritie of fortune, do happilie poſſeſſe themſelues, and communicate their ſufficient means to the ſeruice of their prince, the good of their neighbours, and the bettering of their ovvn eſtate: […]"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "77f58f81-1485-4c41-82ea-84ab87a8edda",
                                                "sense_id": "0a8333a4-a483-38e8-9281-dc45c9a8389a",
                                                "text": "In the course I have taken, I have met, and do daily meet, so many vexations, that I may with truth assure you, that my situation is anything rather than enviable, though it is my happiness to act with those that are far the best that probably ever were engaged in the public service of this country at any time."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2e13f453-4274-4bd8-bbfc-bc36af099711",
                                                "sense_id": "0a8333a4-a483-38e8-9281-dc45c9a8389a",
                                                "text": "This quarter of the city had at that time anything but an enviable reputation. To venture there at night was considered so dangerous that the soldiers from the outlying forts who came in to Paris with permission to go to the theatre, were ordered to halt at the barrière, and not to pass through the perilous district excepting in parties of three or four."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "1ef0b060-e462-48aa-8942-358ca5027eb6",
                        "source_entry_id": "7607d704-ed86-3ce5-94db-5feadcc75b15",
                        "source_sense_id": "06ba7eef-7d91-39d7-9d02-bf68a56d528f",
